          'ier).'#13#10'* Release: time constant for level falls (lower = bouncie' +
          'r).'#13#10'* Peak hold: time the peak LED stays lit after a peak (0 di' +
          'sables it).'#13#10#13#10'Defaults: 10 / 300 / 800 ms (dynamic, snappy look' +
          ').'
      end
